#env
# needs less >= 599
#
# -i  case-insensitive search unless the pattern has an uppercase letter
# -R  pass ANSI colors through (git, bat, delta)
# -S  chop long lines instead of wrapping
# -M  verbose prompt (filename, line range, percentage)
# -W  highlight the first new line after a forward page
LESS = -i -R -S -M -W
